{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Lexer-Lux/Lexeditor/pulls/364","id":4456729326,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTn28Ks8AAAABCaRK7g","html_url":"https://github.com/Lexer-Lux/Lexeditor/pull/364","diff_url":"https://github.com/Lexer-Lux/Lexeditor/pull/364.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Lexer-Lux/Lexeditor/pull/364.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Lexer-Lux/Lexeditor/issues/364","number":364,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"RDR2: faster startup, complete shell restoration, and safer alcohol saves","user":{"login":"Lexer-Lux","id":89482099,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5NDgyMDk5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/89482099?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lexer-Lux","html_url":"https://github.com/Lexer-Lux","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lexer-Lux/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lexer-Lux/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lexer-Lux/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lexer-Lux/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lexer-Lux/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lexer-Lux/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lexer-Lux/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lexer-Lux/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lexer-Lux/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Scope\nFirst implementation batch from the 149 open `rdr2` issues captured for this session. References #347, #144, #131, and the editor-side retirement in #181; records the separate runtime safety work for #357. **This is not completion of all 149 issues.** No issue is automatically closed by this PR.\n\n## Implemented\n### Startup (#347)\nReuse the cached catalog for localization aliases and crafting lookups, honor install.xml paths, retain per-dataset provenance caches, and invalidate provenance on localization changes. Fetch independent boot data concurrently. Keep the loading screen until required data and the final render finish; discard late responses from superseded dataset switches.\n\n### Casing restoration (#144, partial)\nRestore/reblank shell VFX fields across all seven weapon YMT layers, not just the base file. Aggregate status over all layers. Preflight the complete eleven-resource weapon stack, require complete vanilla reference records, preserve projectile flags, respect mapped paths, and roll back files/cache/install.xml on caught write failures. This is not a claim that custom casing momentum/timing calibration is finished.\n\n### Alcohol saves (#131, partial)\nSave sparse edits instead of a stale full table. Merge against current persisted overrides, reject invalid/non-finite/out-of-range input, refuse to silently discard unknown saved entries, show unavailable baselines explicitly, and preserve float precision. Keep deliberate Moonshine=1. The reported universal-1 state was not reproduced in the current dataset; no proven root-cause claim is made.\n\n### Failed binocular speed control (#181)\nHide retired legacy rate/layer keys from the editor schema. Actual runtime removal and prompt-null-safety/trace changes are isolated in the private mod repository, not copied into this public PR.\n\n## Validation\n- **22 Python regression tests pass**, using synthetic fixtures with no game installation required. Includes all-layer restoration, mapped paths, malformed references, late-write/install-map rollback, cache invalidation, sparse/concurrent alcohol saves, and numeric precision.\n- **4 executed Node tests pass** against the actual production boot/dataset-switch JavaScript, including delayed required data, required API failure, optional runtime failure, and stale dataset responses. Inline JavaScript syntax is checked too.\n- RDR2 Python compileall passes.\n- Copied project-data integration: all **61 shell fields across seven layers** restore/reblank, with no other parsed-field changes; original project data untouched.\n- Matched three-before/three-after cold-process API benchmark: median **7.460s -> 4.145s (44.4% lower)** for localization/crafting/catalog loading plus canonical JSON serialization. All three response hashes match across all six runs. This is not end-to-end Windows startup timing.\n- The synthetic regression suites also passed on GitHub before the production commit was pushed. CI remains for future pull requests/master changes.\n\n## Acceptance still open\nNo full browser/visual acceptance or Windows/gameplay test was performed: browser navigation was blocked by environment policy. No production ASI was built or installed. Keep broader gameplay and reported-crash acceptance actionable. Existing issue archives are preserved with appended handoffs.\n\nOnly RDR2 code, focused tests/CI, and the five issue handoffs change. No other game or master branch was edited.","created_at":"2026-09-06T14:54:41Z","updated_at":"2026-09-06T16:23:12Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"f7a7df150905e85e7e4a62fc07d901b2583732a6","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Lexer-Lux/Lexeditor/pulls/364/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Lexer-Lux/Lexeditor/pulls/364/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Lexer-Lux/Lexeditor/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Lexer-Lux/Lexeditor/issues/364/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Lexer-Lux/Lexeditor/statuses/be0b5f4c72446c4378357b72e1f254a06b461d1f","head":{"label":"Lexer-Lux:fix/rdr2-issue-batch","ref":"fix/rdr2-issue-batch","sha":"be0b5f4c72446c4378357b72e1f254a06b461d1f","user":{"login":"Lexer-Lux","id":89482099,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5NDgyMDk5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/89482099?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/use